  "brief": {
    "prose": "Rheasilvia Commons is the Freeport Registry's only ground off Ceres: open commons on the floor of Rheasilvia, the great basin at Vesta's south pole, reached by a passage of days. The basin floor is metal-rich rock under a thin dust, ridged and broken, and nothing is built on it but the pad."
  },
